# Configuration cohesion

Explicit maintainer authorization: analyze and refactor skills, SDD and AGENTS.
No product code, commit, publication or weaker acceptance criteria.

- REQ-01: Preserve unique technical procedures, selection boundaries and authorities while reducing repeated routing text.
- REQ-02: Keep profile, metadata, bridges, links and evidence coherent; preserve previous bytes.
- REQ-03: Measure input size honestly and distinguish structural checks from behavioral efficacy.
- AC-01 → REQ-01: Compare retained technical sections and all bridge artifact contributions with preimages; no lost unique method.
- AC-02 → REQ-02: Profile/metadata/link/freshness checks and negative preservation cases pass.
- AC-03 → REQ-03: Record before/after byte/word measurements, reviewed coverage and remaining semantic/behavioral gaps.
